WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.223
Unit twenty. A Clean Classroom!

2
00:00:04.173 --> 00:00:08.019
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:11.731
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.781 --> 00:00:15.683
Today we learn about A Clean Classroom. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.378 --> 00:00:20.278
Classroom. Say it with me. Classroom!

6
00:00:23.797 --> 00:00:27.114
Clean. Say it with me. Clean!

7
00:00:30.617 --> 00:00:33.951
Bin. Say it with me. Bin!

8
00:00:37.443 --> 00:00:40.859
Tidy. Say it with me. Tidy!

9
00:00:44.339 --> 00:00:47.839
Desk. Say it with me. Desk!

10
00:00:51.366 --> 00:00:54.733
Germs. Say it with me. Germs!

11
00:00:58.232 --> 00:01:01.732
Wash. Say it with me. Wash!

12
00:01:05.226 --> 00:01:08.593
Team. Say it with me. Team!

13
00:01:12.103 --> 00:01:21.938
Our class works as a team to keep the classroom clean. We put rubbish in the bin, tidy each desk, and wash our hands. A clean room has fewer germs.

14
00:01:21.988 --> 00:01:23.318
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.426 --> 00:01:29.605
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.655 --> 00:01:30.805
Bin!

17
00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:37.025
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.075 --> 00:01:38.225
Wash!

19
00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:45.805
Did you know? Wiping desks and washing hands helps stop colds from spreading in class!

20
00:01:45.855 --> 00:01:47.800
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.491 --> 00:01:56.337
Think and answer. What is your job to keep the classroom clean?

22
00:01:56.387 --> 00:01:57.537
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.659 --> 00:02:03.685
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:03.735 --> 00:02:06.437
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

